<title>UK: EBRD sets 100 million rand Eurobond due 1998.</title>
<headline>EBRD sets 100 million rand Eurobond due 1998.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN BANK FOR RECONSTRUCTION AND DEVELOPMENT</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN RAND  COUPON     16	  MATURITY    18.FEB.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.75    PAY DATE    18.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.0	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 5-50	SALE LIMITS SA/US</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  0.50	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
